OL,3,GNEWSAMental health bench shows no-one
OL,4,Ais alone, says mum
OL,5,
OL,6,FA mother who organised a bench to be
OL,7,Finstalled for people struggling with
OL,8,Fmental health issues said it symbolised
OL,9,Fthat people were "not alone".
OL,11,FAnne-Marie, from north
OL,12,FNorthamptonshire, fundraised about
OL,13,F#1,265 to have the bench placed along
OL,14,Fthe Embankment in Wellingborough.
OL,16,FShe said seeing it in situ was a "proud
OL,17,Fand emotional" moment which honoured
OL,18,Fher ex-partner, and father of her two
OL,19,Fsons, who took his own life in 2024.
OL,23,APub: 04-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
